# ...but vendored FastWAM keeps real CODE at paths those two generic rules match:
# configs/data/*.yaml are dataset *configs* (libero_2cam_cosmos.yaml is what training loads),
# and src/fastwam/datasets/** is the dataset implementation (incl. the frame-cache mmap layer).
# A parent directory that stays excluded can never have its children re-included, so these
# negations must name the directories themselves — and must use ** because the names recur at
# several depths (e.g. src/fastwam/datasets/lerobot/lerobot/datasets/).
!third_party/FastWAM/**/data/
!third_party/FastWAM/**/datasets/

# Visualization artifacts
vis/
vis_demo/
vis_droid/
vis_droid_all/
vis_droid_scenes/

